.TH ANNOTATION.GENOMICS 2 2000-1月 "type_features" "type_features"
.SH NAME
type_features \- get the genomics features from the given gff table by its feature type
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fItype_features(\fBgff\fR as <generic> GFFTable, 
\fBtype\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get the genomics features from the given gff table by its feature type
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgff\fB \fR\- 
 a [GFFTable](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Annotation.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.TabularFormat.GFF.GFFTable) genomics feature annotation table object for 
 query the feature data.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtype\fB \fR\- 
 the feature type of the target features, example as \fBgene\fR, \fBCDS\fR 
 or \fBmRNA\fR.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the [Feature](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Annotation.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.TabularFormat.GFF.Feature) genomics feature object that its 
 feature type matches the given type name.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
annotation.genomics
.SH FILES
.PP
